<item>
  <title>Pandas’a Giriş: Gerçek Veriyle İlk Adım</title>
  <dc:creator>Hilal Kerniç Genç</dc:creator>
  <link>https://Hilalkernicgenc.github.io/posts/pandas-giris/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<section id="pandas-nedir" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="pandas-nedir">Pandas nedir?</h2>
<p>Pandas, Python’da veri analizi için kullanılan en temel kütüphanedir. Excel’i Python’da çalıştırmak gibi düşünebilirsin — ama çok daha güçlü. Veri biliminde neredeyse her projede kullanılır.</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb1" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb1-1"><span class="im" style="color: #00769E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">import</span> pandas <span class="im" style="color: #00769E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">as</span> pd</span></code></pre></div></div>
</section>
<section id="dataframe-nedir" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="dataframe-nedir">DataFrame nedir?</h2>
<p>DataFrame, satır ve sütunlardan oluşan bir veri tablosudur. Tıpkı Excel’deki bir sayfa gibi.</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb2" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb2-1"><span class="im" style="color: #00769E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">import</span> pandas <span class="im" style="color: #00769E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">as</span> pd</span>
<span id="cb2-2"></span>
<span id="cb2-3">veri <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> {</span>
<span id="cb2-4">    <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"isim"</span>: [<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"hilal"</span>, <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"ali"</span>, <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"ayşe"</span>],</span>
<span id="cb2-5">    <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"yas"</span>: [<span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">24</span>, <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">28</span>, <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">22</span>],</span>
<span id="cb2-6">    <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"sehir"</span>: [<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"istanbul"</span>, <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"ankara"</span>, <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"izmir"</span>]</span>
<span id="cb2-7">}</span>
<span id="cb2-8"></span>
<span id="cb2-9">df <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> pd.DataFrame(veri)</span>
<span id="cb2-10"><span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">print</span>(df)</span></code></pre></div></div>
</section>
<section id="temel-işlemler" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="temel-işlemler">Temel işlemler</h2>
<section id="veriyi-tanımak" class="level3">
<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="veriyi-tanımak">Veriyi tanımak</h3>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb3" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb3-1">df.shape        <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># (3, 3) — satır, sütun sayısı</span></span>
<span id="cb3-2">df.dtypes       <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># her sütunun tipi</span></span>
<span id="cb3-3">df.head()       <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># ilk 5 satır</span></span>
<span id="cb3-4">df.tail()       <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># son 5 satır</span></span>
<span id="cb3-5">df.describe()   <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># istatistiksel özet</span></span>
<span id="cb3-6">df.info()       <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># genel bilgi</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
</section>
<section id="sütun-seçmek" class="level3">
<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="sütun-seçmek">Sütun seçmek</h3>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb4" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb4-1">df[<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"isim"</span>]           <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># tek sütun — Series döner</span></span>
<span id="cb4-2">df[[<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"isim"</span>, <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"yas"</span>]]  <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># birden fazla sütun — DataFrame döner</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
</section>
<section id="satır-filtrelemek" class="level3">
<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="satır-filtrelemek">Satır filtrelemek</h3>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb5" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb5-1">gencler <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> df[df[<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"yas"</span>] <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">&lt;</span> <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">25</span>]</span>
<span id="cb5-2"><span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">print</span>(gencler)</span>
<span id="cb5-3"></span>
<span id="cb5-4"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">#     isim  yas    sehir</span></span>
<span id="cb5-5"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># 0  hilal   24  istanbul</span></span>
<span id="cb5-6"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># 2   ayşe   22     izmir</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="eksik-veri-kontrolü" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="eksik-veri-kontrolü">Eksik veri kontrolü</h2>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb6" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb6-1">df.isnull().<span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">sum</span>()   <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># her sütundaki eksik değer sayısı</span></span>
<span id="cb6-2">df.dropna()         <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># eksik satırları sil</span></span>
<span id="cb6-3">df.fillna(<span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">0</span>)        <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># eksik değerleri 0 ile doldur</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<blockquote class="blockquote">
<p>Veri temizleme, veri bilimcinin zamanının %80’ini alır. Pandas olmadan bu iş çok daha zor olurdu.</p>
</blockquote>
</section>
<section id="bu-yazıda-öğrendiklerim" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="bu-yazıda-öğrendiklerim">Bu yazıda öğrendiklerim</h2>
<ul>
<li>Pandas kurulumu ve import</li>
<li>DataFrame oluşturma</li>
<li><code>shape</code>, <code>dtypes</code>, <code>head()</code>, <code>describe()</code>, <code>info()</code></li>
<li>Sütun seçme ve satır filtreleme</li>
<li>Eksik veri kontrolü</li>
</ul>
<p>Sıradaki yazıda gerçek bir veri seti indirip Kaggle’dan EDA yapacağım.</p>


</section>

 ]]></description>
