<item>
  <title>Python’da Listeler, Sözlükler ve Döngüler</title>
  <dc:creator>Hilal Kerniç Genç</dc:creator>
  <link>https://Hilalkernicgenc.github.io/posts/listeler-ve-donguler/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<section id="neden-bu-konular-önemli" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="neden-bu-konular-önemli">Neden bu konular önemli?</h2>
<p>Pandas’ta bir veri seti üzerinde çalışırken aslında arka planda sürekli listeler ve sözlüklerle uğraşıyorsun. Bu yapıları anlamadan Pandas’ı anlamak çok zor. O yüzden önce bunları geçiyorum.</p>
</section>
<section id="liste-list" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="liste-list">Liste (list)</h2>
<p>Liste, sıralı ve değiştirilebilir bir veri yapısıdır. Köşeli parantez ile tanımlanır.</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb1" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb1-1">konular <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> [<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"python"</span>, <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"pandas"</span>, <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"istatistik"</span>, <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"makine öğrenmesi"</span>]</span>
<span id="cb1-2"></span>
<span id="cb1-3"><span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">print</span>(konular[<span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">0</span>])    <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># python — index 0'dan başlar</span></span>
<span id="cb1-4"><span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">print</span>(konular[<span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">-</span><span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">1</span>])   <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># makine öğrenmesi — sondan birinci</span></span>
<span id="cb1-5"><span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">print</span>(<span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">len</span>(konular))  <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># 4 — eleman sayısı</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb2" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb2-1"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># eleman ekleme ve silme</span></span>
<span id="cb2-2">konular.append(<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"derin öğrenme"</span>)   <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># sona ekler</span></span>
<span id="cb2-3">konular.remove(<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"istatistik"</span>)      <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># değere göre siler</span></span>
<span id="cb2-4"><span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">print</span>(konular)</span>
<span id="cb2-5"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># ['python', 'pandas', 'makine öğrenmesi', 'derin öğrenme']</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
</section>
<section id="sözlük-dict" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="sözlük-dict">Sözlük (dict)</h2>
<p>Sözlük, anahtar-değer çiftlerinden oluşur. Veri biliminde çok sık karşılaşırsın — JSON verisi, model parametreleri, kolon eşleştirme gibi durumlarda.</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb3" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb3-1">ogrenci <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> {</span>
<span id="cb3-2">    <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"isim"</span>: <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"hilal"</span>,</span>
<span id="cb3-3">    <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"yas"</span>: <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">24</span>,</span>
<span id="cb3-4">    <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"seviye"</span>: <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"başlangıç"</span></span>
<span id="cb3-5">}</span>
<span id="cb3-6"></span>
<span id="cb3-7"><span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">print</span>(ogrenci[<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"isim"</span>])     <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># hilal</span></span>
<span id="cb3-8"><span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">print</span>(ogrenci.get(<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"yas"</span>))  <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># 24</span></span>
<span id="cb3-9"></span>
<span id="cb3-10"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># yeni anahtar ekleme</span></span>
<span id="cb3-11">ogrenci[<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"konu"</span>] <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"python"</span></span>
<span id="cb3-12"><span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">print</span>(ogrenci)</span></code></pre></div></div>
</section>
<section id="döngüler" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="döngüler">Döngüler</h2>
<section id="for-döngüsü" class="level3">
<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="for-döngüsü">for döngüsü</h3>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb4" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb4-1">konular <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> [<span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"python"</span>, <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"pandas"</span>, <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"istatistik"</span>]</span>
<span id="cb4-2"></span>
<span id="cb4-3"><span class="cf" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">for</span> konu <span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">in</span> konular:</span>
<span id="cb4-4">    <span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">print</span>(<span class="ss" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">f"</span><span class="sc" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">{</span>konu<span class="sc" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">}</span><span class="ss" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"> öğreniyorum"</span>)</span>
<span id="cb4-5"></span>
<span id="cb4-6"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># python öğreniyorum</span></span>
<span id="cb4-7"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># pandas öğreniyorum</span></span>
<span id="cb4-8"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># istatistik öğreniyorum</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
</section>
<section id="enumerate-index-ile-birlikte" class="level3">
<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="enumerate-index-ile-birlikte">enumerate — index ile birlikte</h3>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb5" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb5-1"><span class="cf" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">for</span> i, konu <span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">in</span> <span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">enumerate</span>(konular):</span>
<span id="cb5-2">    <span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">print</span>(<span class="ss" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">f"</span><span class="sc" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">{</span>i<span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">+</span><span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">1</span><span class="sc" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">}</span><span class="ss" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">. </span><span class="sc" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">{</span>konu<span class="sc" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">}</span><span class="ss" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"</span>)</span>
<span id="cb5-3"></span>
<span id="cb5-4"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># 1. python</span></span>
<span id="cb5-5"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># 2. pandas</span></span>
<span id="cb5-6"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># 3. istatistik</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<blockquote class="blockquote">
<p>Veri biliminde <code>enumerate</code> çok işe yarar — hem index hem değere aynı anda erişirsin.</p>
</blockquote>
</section>
</section>
<section id="list-comprehension" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="list-comprehension">List comprehension</h2>
<p>Tek satırda liste oluşturmanın Python’a özgü yolu. Pandas ile çalışırken sık kullanırsın.</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb6" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb6-1">sayilar <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> [<span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">1</span>, <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">2</span>, <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">3</span>, <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">4</span>, <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">5</span>]</span>
<span id="cb6-2"></span>
<span id="cb6-3">kareler <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> [x<span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">**</span><span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">2</span> <span class="cf" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">for</span> x <span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">in</span> sayilar]</span>
<span id="cb6-4"><span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">print</span>(kareler)  <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># [1, 4, 9, 16, 25]</span></span>
<span id="cb6-5"></span>
<span id="cb6-6"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># koşullu</span></span>
<span id="cb6-7">ciftler <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> [x <span class="cf" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">for</span> x <span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">in</span> sayilar <span class="cf" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">if</span> x <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
